The evaluation corpus tests/gold.jsonl (not part of the runtime image) contains
coordinates, administrative codes and addresses derived from:
- Wikidata (CC0-1.0) and the Dutch BAG via PDOK (CC0-1.0);
- Base Adresse Nationale, licensed under Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0
  (https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence/);
- the US Census Bureau geocoder (US Government work, public domain);
- the ONS Postcode Directory via postcodes.io, licensed under the Open
  Government Licence v3.0 (https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/).
  Contains OS data © Crown copyright and database right. Contains Royal Mail
  data © Royal Mail copyright and database right. Source: Office for National Statistics.
Per-case sources and retrieval dates are recorded in the corpus; `evaluate build-gold` regenerates it
from tests/gold.seeds.jsonl.

